		{
			"type": "Markdown",
			"text": "`:parked[…]` marks an item as kept but out of scope for now. With an ID like `{#P1}`, it works the way your log's `↳ builds on` links do: you can pick the item up later by name. That fits the idea from your 3 Oct planning note, where decision IDs work like citations instead of getting lost in the text."
		}
